            <div xml:id="m-619b62fb-cbfa-485e-8fba-4748102ec588">
              <lg xml:id="m-7a6392ce-6a6b-4327-b8cb-8b18e4c4d534">
                <l xml:id="m-fadd7d7c-0a75-4a79-91d0-20f9c3f3875a" facs="#m-142fc4a2-38f4-4c05-8df9-54104e6654ef" label="text-like">Septuagesima Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-46396131-ed9c-423d-bb3d-8fae6d05559f" facs="#m-6db93232-e538-4ff3-bd59-e57377d5fe7b" label="ambiguous">408</l><l xml:id="m-42f2be85-97f1-4a24-abaa-82c62fac95c6" facs="#m-de9ad66c-93c4-431d-8ea7-7821d8377d56" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-5a66d8ec-cbe8-46e9-9f2f-8916d8a6f704" facs="#m-0681ec80-bfdf-4be6-863b-6bebb865ca8f" label="lyrics-like">DReces pópuli tui, quaésumus ! affligimur, * pro tui nóminis glória</l><l xml:id="m-237142d1-5922-43df-b8d4-2390d130ef8c" facs="#m-c2002271-f4de-4582-8fd5-5d62e503e533" label="lyrics-like">misericórditer liberémur. Per Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-c53152bb-92f4-4f45-8d17-1cf9aaf954c2" facs="#m-90c6c172-cea8-44b6-ac45-fdd2e5deed53" label="lyrics-like">EDómine, cleménter exáudi:</l><l xml:id="m-9293741f-2e9f-43c4-a93e-6baf5e0ded60" facs="#m-4ea7a31d-3659-44ce-80ef-746d1b711354" label="lyrics-like">ut qui juste pro peccátis nostris! minum.</l><l xml:id="m-110a9da5-af51-44ba-9358-82187883f9a2" facs="#m-c8749dd3-ddb6-4970-8791-07cddde31b1b" label="text-like">Second Collect. To implore the intercession of the Saints.</l><l xml:id="m-7fbed174-b88e-450a-a28a-95d0aa49b16b" facs="#m-472a4417-e649-4c59-ad0f-04ec4284a208" label="lyrics-like">cunctis nos, quaésumus Dómine, l salútem nobis tribue benígnus et</l><l xml:id="m-43f3dfab-7dc9-4ff1-8f8a-731f155c6134" facs="#m-d5f223cd-a43b-44bc-ab22-16f0681c1ebd" label="lyrics-like">I mentis et córporis defénde</l><l xml:id="m-29ec2d3a-da74-4a5e-a527-56fc6e25f151" facs="#m-c72dce07-5412-48fc-ab72-9821c842a5c8" label="lyrics-like">pacem; ut destrúctis adversitátibus</l><l xml:id="m-bea1e186-af40-45e0-8208-d542260a560c" facs="#m-3df0d561-df19-4ea1-9770-fdd6853e511d" label="lyrics-like">et erróribus univérsis, Ecclésia tua</l><l xml:id="m-f788afd8-7c4c-4dda-b86b-85186361ea57" facs="#m-58ee27bb-08b2-4951-b75d-06edb4616c70" label="lyrics-like">periculis: et, intercedénte beâta et</l><l xml:id="m-41c8c0bc-fcaf-43a8-959a-c5b6524724db" facs="#m-f57378bb-02f6-44fa-9ed2-ef2f1897aff3" label="lyrics-like">gloriósa semper Virgine Dei Geni¬</l><l xml:id="m-0e7f7536-a37b-4f1d-94cc-f3a77e377f13" facs="#m-6f5438a8-3582-44c1-8cb6-56bc4c9e5197" label="lyrics-like">secúra tibi sérviat libertáte. (Per</l><l xml:id="m-4fc279d3-7374-4f1a-8e46-d143399f30cd" facs="#m-3c4510d2-c1b2-4fca-bf2f-1cf1e6a864e0" label="lyrics-like">eúmdem Dóminum. s said only</l><l xml:id="m-d5845e4c-9d2a-464c-adda-960b5e5c5228" facs="#m-27c93d15-9407-4ff2-b3d2-9a14fa358841" label="lyrics-like">trice Maria, cum beâto Joseph,</l><l xml:id="m-bf5cfc6c-fdc2-476f-9be9-08e3d6004541" facs="#m-6bc5338a-75eb-4a05-a71d-c02ee0ec1755" label="lyrics-like">beátis Apóstolis tuis Petro et Paulo,</l><l xml:id="m-13a11536-cc3c-4413-a45f-4fd2f8e4a756" facs="#m-87400f76-90e9-4361-be8c-0fef29f04cb7" label="text-like">when this is the last Collect.)</l><l xml:id="m-191f2176-82e1-4113-afbd-b4ee8d9903c1" facs="#m-460d9f94-cc9c-440f-a473-a2c1f8ff739e" label="lyrics-like">atque beâto N. et ómnibus Sanctis,</l><l xml:id="m-e2a99c5e-284b-4663-bd1d-cc8781179d7e" facs="#m-30f66fb4-4286-4a75-a364-97d8eeed0849" label="text-like">Third Collect at the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-f3ecf81d-27c7-4bd5-a66a-b8bf1dc5e9e5" facs="#m-3bd74214-ba6f-4109-8bc7-158a7ca830a5" label="lyrics-like">Berore the Purineation, Second Collect of Our Lady. Deus qui salútis.</l><l xml:id="m-b2390c91-252a-439f-a5e2-41a50bad8743" facs="#m-80fbbce4-5230-45ff-8c0d-8a4338ba015a" label="text-like">.41. Third for the Church or for the Pope, p. 819.</l><l xml:id="m-6cd51953-ff65-4054-b454-8fc5aed4285f" facs="#m-b7ceda4a-8992-4a51-8a42-b6f1b04847be" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Corinthios. 1. Cor. 9.</l><l xml:id="m-fa6316a2-98ec-4ae2-bf16-00985dea119e" facs="#m-2d07e8df-82bb-420d-8ab7-75439c7740f9" label="lyrics-like">Ratres: Nescítis quod ii qui in rim, ipse réprobus efficiar. Nolo</l><l xml:id="m-d0083cea-13c4-467e-a792-de871ca713b6" facs="#m-49a81bee-6946-4c66-8332-00ae6b1a73e3" label="lyrics-like">stádio currunt, omnes quidem</l><l xml:id="m-8f1dbe5f-ac9e-4cfb-ab7c-cf5022963620" facs="#m-a4bade2d-0166-43e5-af8d-c597fb4cd866" label="lyrics-like">enim vos ignoráre, fratres, quóniam</l><l xml:id="m-d7f5c619-5df0-43ee-8875-57ebab326168" facs="#m-6b6816fa-9609-4330-8bc3-f2cff26de1fd" label="lyrics-like">currunt, sed unus áccipit bravium?</l><l xml:id="m-0f6babaa-5109-4e30-a411-50dca877f5f1" facs="#m-6a7cc534-7d7f-4e7d-84c6-5633b85b6d7d" label="lyrics-like">patres nostri omnes sub nube fué¬</l><l xml:id="m-2a621b0f-2c3d-4d92-bb19-e7b5dd2eb134" facs="#m-ca307ccf-eafc-4901-9158-1a5a16c06b38" label="lyrics-like">Sic cúrrite, ut comprehendátis.</l><l xml:id="m-5c2be164-14a8-4930-b965-521a941dd890" facs="#m-21b0beea-a59c-4387-99ce-b921d6b1834c" label="lyrics-like">runt, et omnes mare transiérunt,</l><l xml:id="m-519bf177-93d5-441a-be5b-355d9d961bf6" facs="#m-d410b3eb-29a6-47d1-986e-1c433b4d0ab4" label="lyrics-like">Omnis autem, qui in agóne con¬</l><l xml:id="m-9e308eb5-e6f5-4fa7-884e-3f0dc56bf971" facs="#m-3e340e74-2c52-4319-970d-3c4c707641a2" label="lyrics-like">et omnes in Móyse baptizáti sunt</l><l xml:id="m-971caf4e-5f49-4d95-bbf6-f7d6b79d4c4b" facs="#m-f28b3edd-c71e-4e10-acc1-4735d0212158" label="lyrics-like">téndit, ab ómnibus se ábstinet: et</l><l xml:id="m-7f3a7559-1e3b-474d-8483-1d3b9ef1c581" facs="#m-6a419076-ba06-4a43-be80-2937fcac84c4" label="lyrics-like">in nube, et in mari: et omnes eám¬</l><l xml:id="m-d3768a76-c89b-4bb4-8929-50fe0ae2e03a" facs="#m-f04c76fe-588c-43cf-b310-92b767a130a2" label="lyrics-like">illi quidem ut corruptibilem coró¬</l><l xml:id="m-b5f2240e-abc4-49e9-a92a-7b3d13be3ae5" facs="#m-0685736c-1689-4912-aeae-4c2e59fa3e49" label="lyrics-like">dem escam spiritálem manducavé¬</l><l xml:id="m-5c6d98b4-a781-43f2-82dd-3b0be8572736" facs="#m-91a62bc1-45fc-401b-8626-a15d151f0a02" label="lyrics-like">nam accípiant; nos autem incor¬</l><l xml:id="m-aeb88907-26aa-42bb-b9df-6e533c8b4172" facs="#m-810bdb85-7fc2-4551-b075-acc068eb5ad2" label="lyrics-like">runt, et omnes eúmdem potum spi¬</l><l xml:id="m-f62f07e7-ff9a-46a8-9938-a968d626b262" facs="#m-e74b2848-f6d2-478e-90aa-c416c9dd1fdc" label="lyrics-like">ritálem bibérunt: (bibébant autem</l><l xml:id="m-50aeca56-8d09-406b-ab9e-03748186748f" facs="#m-0de7a0c9-ab90-4e1d-8c5c-d97d0b2c1ff8" label="lyrics-like">rúptam. Ego igitur sic curro, non</l><l xml:id="m-e5ffdb14-bb1c-42db-85b5-531b23a51835" facs="#m-d670cd16-8346-4d86-a978-09ca63ad4a83" label="lyrics-like">de spiritáli, consequénte eos, petra:</l><l xml:id="m-3f8bb519-2bd4-44ff-80ee-6b864b188681" facs="#m-a58833f4-af67-4abf-ab2e-0402d616a121" label="lyrics-like">quasi in incértum: sic pugno, non</l><l xml:id="m-5b4b7f22-779a-46ba-9f30-e35205726b0b" facs="#m-cb6c2879-1e96-4dd4-86fd-e08d9278b516" label="ambiguous">petra autem erat Christus) sed non</l><l xml:id="m-6047fa53-a656-4027-a7f6-46a2fc134cec" facs="#m-67f113a7-88fd-49cf-b69f-5c358a5bc00c" label="lyrics-like">quasi áerem vérberans: sed castígo</l><l xml:id="m-61ccc57a-1421-49ad-a94d-519308a05c91" facs="#m-44a7c82e-7808-449c-9c19-a924378c43ca" label="lyrics-like">corpus meum, et in servitútem réd-] in plúribus eórum beneplácitum est</l><l xml:id="m-8aff0263-812f-48f4-9076-941f4d2a2959" facs="#m-b5ab2bf9-71c7-426d-80ec-5d5119232cc5" label="lyrics-like">igo: ne forte cum áliis praedicáve-! Deo.</l><l xml:id="m-2abc1132-f890-4829-a47d-a9f5bab7e98c" facs="#m-7658f0a0-20c9-4816-b2b7-c6be8a24d934" label="ambiguous">crad.</l><l xml:id="m-dd25b03b-9f00-4d05-b6d0-8b481b49789b" facs="#m-72762056-a241-491e-bbe0-a7f5d3bfa380" label="ambiguous">3.</l><l xml:id="m-5e2a1586-e6a5-4999-bf69-e351a8c2ae21" facs="#m-a8e0bd87-6e83-4005-ac31-c72e7e532867" label="lyrics-like">A Diú¬</l><l xml:id="m-b63da29b-e51c-438f-82cf-a22b2107776e" facs="#m-c68faeb5-0c99-4c16-ba79-67efa9f3ba67" label="lyrics-like">tá- ti- bus,</l><l xml:id="m-9856daa7-d8c7-4bb9-a068-6007e8dfa957" facs="#m-e99f76eb-ae87-484f-ab8b-31ecad0f7b99" label="ambiguous">tor* in opportu-ni¬</l><l xml:id="m-3d0dc8cb-f997-41d5-bb22-a0e06d920fd3" facs="#m-b88224fa-9652-49a5-a6a6-fb9957989d7b" label="lyrics-like">in tri-bu-la-ti-6́¬</l><l xml:id="m-5056c2b9-7639-4e3a-bb8a-4783255f8f46" facs="#m-300a9269-85b1-4aba-863c-e600e9d2cb0c" label="lyrics-like">ne: spé-rent in</l><l xml:id="m-3f9e2aee-9759-41df-81fb-47d972133e04" facs="#m-3d77868b-f67d-4312-8153-4adc6555ef3b" label="ambiguous">te,</l><l xml:id="m-e4d0e2db-2e61-4273-9e2e-3abb3b0502fe" facs="#m-1e2a9228-6cb7-42e8-b9ae-0f4b18dc1299" label="lyrics-like">qui nové-runt te:</l><l xml:id="m-c9989534-7524-40ae-ae27-2ece651f8869" facs="#m-768b01fc-fc27-42a4-8ec1-134b78855e3c" label="ambiguous">dere¬</l><l xml:id="m-7ad65c2f-9aac-4cd2-b280-5ea461d01f71" facs="#m-edd5441b-d6ae-4313-9638-2ec69d4d4371" label="lyrics-like">quó-ni-am non</l><l xml:id="m-dd26bf44-1935-42e2-87fb-a6b175f34b01" facs="#m-2bfd0229-e0ad-4629-a35d-8cc3e2975618" label="lyrics-like">Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-e149af8e-e759-4c8b-b0d3-6e82cad49ee9" facs="#m-984322ed-05d6-4b8f-b6c2-ac2cdc12ca03" label="lyrics-like">línquis quae-réntes te,</l><l xml:id="m-f3aaa856-95fe-42b3-95ad-dd07a755fc79" facs="#m-e2026c9e-7b75-42b9-92b9-f9a666b0d163" label="ambiguous">mi- ne.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>